      "writtenOn": "2023-10-18T22:21:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This could use a timeout and error code so the caller can revert to the waiting for ACK1 state.\n\nI recommend moving the polling loop into serial.c, which will simplify all the callers.\n\n```\nfor (i \u003d 0; i \u003c 4; i++) {\n    if (serial_receive_host_char(\u0026rx_data, timeout_ms) !\u003d NO_ERROR)\n       return TIMEOUT_ERR;\n    }\n    rx_buff[i] \u003d rx_data;\n}\n```",
      "revId": "b918d4aa6f0b27a60cbdd5ceec825fa54732996d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
