      "writtenOn": "2023-10-18T22:21:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This function should be split into 2 - receive_program_data() and program_data().\n\nThe caller then does the following:\n```\n    static uint8_t *rx_buffer \u003d DATA_IO_BUFFER;\n    static uint32_t offset \u003d 0;\n    /* receive_program_data() should validate the header offset against\n     * expected offset.\n     */\n    receive_program_data(rxData, rx_buffer, offset, \u0026len);\n    offset +\u003d len;\n    if (offset \u003d\u003d MAX_CHUNK_SIZE)\n        program_length \u003d offset;\n        program_data(flash_addr, rx_buffer, progrm_length);\n        flash_addr +\u003d program_length;\n    \n```",
