      "message": "This might be simplified by creating two separate states, WAIT_FOR_ACK1 and WAIT_FOR_ACK2.\n```\ncase STATE_WAIT_FOR_ACK1:\n    if (rxData \u003d\u003d CMD_ACK1)\n        state \u003d WAIT_FOR_ACK2;\n    break;\ncase STATE_WAIT_FOR_ACK2:\n    if (rxData \u003d\u003d CMD_ACK2)\n        state \u003d STATE_WAIT_FOR_FLASH_CMD;\n        /* Send ack to host */\n    else\n        state \u003d STATE_WAIT_FOR_ACK1;\n```",
